# V11R-D-1 token pipeline reproducibility pins.
#
# The frozen design-system tokens are compiled by a generator whose output must be byte-identical on
# every checkout (AC1). core.autocrlf=true would rewrite LF to CRLF in the working tree and break the
# generated-artifact comparison, so every pipeline output (and its XAML source) is pinned to LF here.
*.axaml text eol=lf
Generated/*.g.cs text eol=lf
Generated/*.md text eol=lf
